    "surgery-midterm-q0632": { lecture: "Lower Abdominal Pain", aiAnswer: ["A", "C"], explanation: "In lower urinary-tract symptoms, digital rectal examination assesses prostate size and consistency and looks for suspicious nodules; both recorded answers are clinically relevant." },
